{
 "page": "facility/highlands-youth-academy-fl",
 "name": "Highlands Youth Academy",
 "from": "pilot rec05",
 "sentences": [
  [
   {
    "text": "Highlands Youth Academy, also called Avon Park Youth Academy, was a secure residential facility for boys in the Florida Department of Juvenile Justice system, in Avon Park.",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.wusf.org/law-order/2013-08-18/juveniles-riot-at-polk-county-facility",
      "cite": "WUSF, Aug 18, 2013"
     },
     {
      "url": "https://www.fox13news.com/news/report-g4s-run-youth-facility-should-be-closed-in-wake-of-riots",
      "cite": "FOX 13, Jul 20, 2015"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "For years it was run by the private contractor G4S.",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.wusf.org/law-order/2013-08-18/juveniles-riot-at-polk-county-facility",
      "cite": "WUSF, Aug 18, 2013"
     },
     {
      "url": "https://www.fox13news.com/news/report-g4s-run-youth-facility-should-be-closed-in-wake-of-riots",
      "cite": "FOX 13, Jul 20, 2015"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Its problems were public for years before it closed in October 2019.",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.wusf.org/law-order/2013-08-18/juveniles-riot-at-polk-county-facility",
      "cite": "WUSF, Aug 18, 2013"
     },
     {
      "url": "https://www.fox13news.com/news/report-g4s-run-youth-facility-should-be-closed-in-wake-of-riots",
      "cite": "FOX 13, Jul 20, 2015"
     },
     {
      "url": "https://www.midfloridanewspapers.com/highlands_news-sun/news/highlands-youth-academy-closes-with-contract-expiration/article_d65b7976-fbe2-11e9-9295-231b842dc667.html",
      "cite": "Highlands News-Sun, Oct 31, 2019"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "A 2013 riot wrecked 18 of its 20 buildings, and a 2015 grand jury said the facility should be shut down.",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.wusf.org/law-order/2013-08-18/juveniles-riot-at-polk-county-facility",
      "cite": "WUSF, Aug 18, 2013"
     },
     {
      "url": "https://www.fox13news.com/news/report-g4s-run-youth-facility-should-be-closed-in-wake-of-riots",
      "cite": "FOX 13, Jul 20, 2015"
     },
     {
      "url": "https://www.midfloridanewspapers.com/highlands_news-sun/news/highlands-youth-academy-closes-with-contract-expiration/article_d65b7976-fbe2-11e9-9295-231b842dc667.html",
      "cite": "Highlands News-Sun, Oct 31, 2019"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "In 2017 three of its former administrators were arrested on charges of covering up abuse and neglect.",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.fox13news.com/news/three-former-g4s-employees-arrested-on-felony-charges",
      "cite": "FOX 13, Aug 18, 2017"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  [
   {
    "text": "The academy, designed by the Department of Juvenile Justice, held about 212 adjudicated boys in 2002 for stays of about nine months of academic and vocational training, followed by an aftercare program called STREET Smart.",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://ojp.gov/ncjrs/virtual-library/abstracts/hammer-and-nail-approach-rebuilding-young-lives-floridas-avon-park",
      "cite": "Corrections Today, June 2002 (NCJRS abstract)"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "By then Securicor New Century, a company based in Richmond, Virginia, ran the academy, having taken over its operation from Correctional Services Corp.",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://lasvegassun.com/news/2002/aug/09/summit-views-woes-remain/",
      "cite": "Las Vegas Sun, Aug 9, 2002"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "It later took moderate-risk boys aged 16 to 18.",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://crimesolutions.ojp.gov/ratedprograms/533",
      "cite": "CrimeSolutions (U.S. Justice Department)"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "G4S ran it under a five-year, $40 million contract with the department.",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.fox13news.com/news/report-g4s-run-youth-facility-should-be-closed-in-wake-of-riots",
      "cite": "FOX 13, Jul 20, 2015"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "In August 2013 it held 138 boys.",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.wusf.org/law-order/2013-08-18/juveniles-riot-at-polk-county-facility",
      "cite": "WUSF, Aug 18, 2013"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  [
   {
    "text": "On the evening of August 17, 2013, a fight after a basketball game between groups of boys from Orlando and St. Petersburg grew into a riot.",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.wusf.org/law-order/2013-08-18/juveniles-riot-at-polk-county-facility",
      "cite": "WUSF, Aug 18, 2013"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "The boys destroyed 18 of the facility's 20 buildings, set fire to an office holding juvenile records and took staff radios and golf carts; seven were hospitalized.",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.wusf.org/law-order/2013-08-18/juveniles-riot-at-polk-county-facility",
      "cite": "WUSF, Aug 18, 2013"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Sixty-one were arrested.",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.fox13news.com/news/three-former-g4s-employees-arrested-on-felony-charges",
      "cite": "FOX 13, Aug 18, 2017"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "In March 2015 a boy escaped while five staff members were in the room, and a Polk County grand jury began investigating.",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.fox13news.com/news/report-g4s-run-youth-facility-should-be-closed-in-wake-of-riots",
      "cite": "FOX 13, Jul 20, 2015"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Sheriff Grady Judd later said staff took four hours to tell his office about a 2015 escape.",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.fox13news.com/news/sheriff-highlands-youth-academy-is-unequivocal-train-wreck",
      "cite": "FOX 13, Aug 18, 2017"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "His investigation found that many escapes had never been reported to the sheriff.",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.fox13news.com/news/three-former-g4s-employees-arrested-on-felony-charges",
      "cite": "FOX 13, Aug 18, 2017"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  [
   {
    "text": "In July 2015 the grand jury's report said the buildings were in disrepair and not secure, the boys were improperly supervised and the staff was \"woefully under-trained.\"",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.fox13news.com/news/report-g4s-run-youth-facility-should-be-closed-in-wake-of-riots",
      "cite": "FOX 13, Jul 20, 2015"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "It called for the facility to be closed.",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.fox13news.com/news/report-g4s-run-youth-facility-should-be-closed-in-wake-of-riots",
      "cite": "FOX 13, Jul 20, 2015"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Judd said G4S kept staff from reporting violent incidents.",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.fox13news.com/news/report-g4s-run-youth-facility-should-be-closed-in-wake-of-riots",
      "cite": "FOX 13, Jul 20, 2015"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "The department kept the facility open, said it was spending more than $2 million on renovations and improvements, and kept contracting with G4S until March 2017.",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.fox13news.com/news/report-g4s-run-youth-facility-should-be-closed-in-wake-of-riots",
      "cite": "FOX 13, Jul 20, 2015"
     },
     {
      "url": "https://www.fox13news.com/news/three-former-g4s-employees-arrested-on-felony-charges",
      "cite": "FOX 13, Aug 18, 2017"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  [
   {
    "text": "Abuse inside went unreported for years.",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.fox13news.com/news/three-former-g4s-employees-arrested-on-felony-charges",
      "cite": "FOX 13, Aug 18, 2017"
     },
     {
      "url": "https://www.fox13news.com/news/sheriff-highlands-youth-academy-is-unequivocal-train-wreck",
      "cite": "FOX 13, Aug 18, 2017"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "In November 2015 detectives got tips about crimes that had never been reported, including sexual contact between staff and residents.",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.fox13news.com/news/three-former-g4s-employees-arrested-on-felony-charges",
      "cite": "FOX 13, Aug 18, 2017"
     },
     {
      "url": "https://www.fox13news.com/news/sheriff-highlands-youth-academy-is-unequivocal-train-wreck",
      "cite": "FOX 13, Aug 18, 2017"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "In May 2016 they arrested Deidre Baucom, a youth care worker, who later pleaded guilty to sexual misconduct with a juvenile.",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.fox13news.com/news/three-former-g4s-employees-arrested-on-felony-charges",
      "cite": "FOX 13, Aug 18, 2017"
     },
     {
      "url": "https://www.fox13news.com/news/sheriff-highlands-youth-academy-is-unequivocal-train-wreck",
      "cite": "FOX 13, Aug 18, 2017"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "On August 17, 2017, the sheriff's office arrested the former facility administrator, Norma Wynn, and two former assistant administrators, Jose Sanchez and Johnny Hart.",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://bradley.polksheriff.org/news-investigations/2017/08/18/three-former-department-of-juvenile-justice-g4s-highlands-youth-academy-staff-members-arrested-for-multiple-felonies",
      "cite": "Polk County Sheriff's Office, Aug 18, 2017"
     },
     {
      "url": "https://www.fox13news.com/news/three-former-g4s-employees-arrested-on-felony-charges",
      "cite": "FOX 13, Aug 18, 2017"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "They were accused of destroying or tampering with evidence, failing to report child abuse and willfully neglecting the juveniles in their care.",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://bradley.polksheriff.org/news-investigations/2017/08/18/three-former-department-of-juvenile-justice-g4s-highlands-youth-academy-staff-members-arrested-for-multiple-felonies",
      "cite": "Polk County Sheriff's Office, Aug 18, 2017"
     },
     {
      "url": "https://www.fox13news.com/news/three-former-g4s-employees-arrested-on-felony-charges",
      "cite": "FOX 13, Aug 18, 2017"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Hart was by then running the Okaloosa Youth Development Center.",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.fox13news.com/news/three-former-g4s-employees-arrested-on-felony-charges",
      "cite": "FOX 13, Aug 18, 2017"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Judd called the academy \"an absolute, unequivocal train wreck.\"",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.fox13news.com/news/sheriff-highlands-youth-academy-is-unequivocal-train-wreck",
      "cite": "FOX 13, Aug 18, 2017"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  [
   {
    "text": "In 2017 an investment fund bought G4S's youth business for $56.5 million, and it was renamed TrueCore Behavioral Solutions.",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.tampabay28.com/news/local-news/i-team-investigates/girls-death-other-issues-spark-concerns-involving-other-florida-facilities-run-by-truecore",
      "cite": "ABC Action News (Tampa Bay 28)"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "TrueCore ran Highlands until October 2019, when the facility closed as its contract with the department expired.",
    "sources": [
     {
      "url": "https://www.midfloridanewspapers.com/highlands_news-sun/news/highlands-youth-academy-closes-with-contract-expiration/article_d65b7976-fbe2-11e9-9295-231b842dc667.html",
      "cite": "Highlands News-Sun, Oct 31, 2019"
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 ],
